        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / FACTORY 003\nCLOCKWORK PULSES\n\nRun your DAW transport to clock the\n16-step melody. GridSeq drives Plaits\npitch and trigger; an LFO slowly alters\nthe timbre. Plateau adds spacious tails.\n\nEdit GridSeq notes or Plaits engine to\nreshape this rhythmic texture.\n\nAuthor: MODULAR-SYNTH factory team\n",
